Subject: Cantor M2B Windows Platform Preflight Runtime

Description: Canonical implementation and exact-fixture execution authority for one isolated, root-only, read-only Windows platform preflight. It does not authorize topology traversal, content access, scanner output, receipt issuance, candidate admission, launch, seal, or promotion.

